!!Editor Keys

|<kbd>CTRL + S</kbd>|Save
|<kbd>Shift + CTRL + S</kbd>|Save All
|<kbd>CTRL + F</kbd>|Start Searching
|<kbd>CTRL + G</kbd>|Find Next
|<kbd>Shift + Ctrl + G</kbd>|Find Previous
|<kbd>Shift + Ctrl + F</kbd>|Replace
|<kbd>Shift + Ctrl + R</kbd>|Replace All
|<kbd>SHIFT + Tab</kbd>|Format Selected Text
